# Arlo (Cursor)

Persistent single-user Discord companion: mem0 + PostgreSQL, LangGraph agent, APScheduler proactive DMs.

**Full context:** `AGENTS.md` (status + roadmap). **Architecture:** `docs/architecture.md`. **Claude parity:** `CLAUDE.md`.

## Build state

- Phases 1–3 shipped: bot, memory, `schedules`/digest, Tavily search.
- **Phase 4 next:** ReAct tools in `orchestrator.py`, implement `read_url`, schedule write tools — not done yet.
- `orchestrator.py` is still a single `chat` node (no tool loop).
- No `/digest` command; proactive jobs live in `schedules` table.

## Non-negotiables

- No classifier/planner LLM calls; no in-place mutation.
- Context from `episodic_messages`, not Discord API history.
- `DISCORD_USER_ID` filter on every message; validate URLs before Jina fetch.
- Background memory extraction only (`asyncio.create_task`).
- One-line commit messages; ≥80% `core` test coverage target.
- Self-hosted mem0 — no mem0 cloud API key.

